{"unit_id":"huaxiren6__DSH-EmailReader#card-zh","repo":"huaxiren6/DSH-EmailReader","commit":"c96afef4427bf7dc359f5375e92ad6ac334a26b9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-email-reader 是一款 DSH 邮件插件，通过注册模型可调用的 IMAP 工具，让用户在会话中查看和检索邮箱内容。它提供最近邮件列表、单封邮件正文读取和按关键词搜索，并能选择多个配置账号或临时覆盖连接信息。OAuth refresh token 可换取访问令牌，也可使用密码或现成 access token；正文在本地解析 MIME 后返回。适合需要让 DSH 帮忙查阅邮箱的用户，需配置 IMAP 主机、用户名及可用认证信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:252-266","src/index.js:311-320","src/index.js:410-478"]}
{"unit_id":"huaxiren6__DSH-EmailReader#card-en","repo":"huaxiren6/DSH-EmailReader","commit":"c96afef4427bf7dc359f5375e92ad6ac334a26b9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-email-reader adds IMAP tools to DSH for listing recent mail, reading a message body, and searching by keyword. Users can select an account and mailbox. It supports password or OAuth authentication and parses message text locally. An IMAP host, username, and valid credentials are required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:252-266","src/index.js:311-320","src/index.js:410-478"]}
