{"unit_id":"huaxiren6__DSH-EmailReader#feature-1","repo":"huaxiren6/DSH-EmailReader","commit":"c96afef4427bf7dc359f5375e92ad6ac334a26b9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-email-reader 的功能「邮件列表」：ol_email_list 可按账号和文件夹列出最近邮件，返回发件人、主题、日期和旗标；limit 默认 20，最多 100。调用时可选择配置账号或提供连接覆盖。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:266-320"]}
{"unit_id":"huaxiren6__DSH-EmailReader#feature-2","repo":"huaxiren6/DSH-EmailReader","commit":"c96afef4427bf7dc359f5375e92ad6ac334a26b9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-email-reader 的功能「读取邮件正文」：ol_email_read 按邮件序号或 UID 读取单封邮件的主题、发件人、日期和正文；插件获取原始邮件并在本地解析 MIME 文本，正文最多返回 200,000 个字符。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:358-409"]}
{"unit_id":"huaxiren6__DSH-EmailReader#feature-3","repo":"huaxiren6/DSH-EmailReader","commit":"c96afef4427bf7dc359f5375e92ad6ac334a26b9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-email-reader 的功能「邮件关键词搜索」：ol_email_search 使用 IMAP 服务端文本搜索查找邮件，并按最新结果返回邮件摘要；可指定账号、文件夹和结果数量。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:410-478"]}
{"unit_id":"huaxiren6__DSH-EmailReader#feature-4","repo":"huaxiren6/DSH-EmailReader","commit":"c96afef4427bf7dc359f5375e92ad6ac334a26b9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-email-reader 的功能「多账号与认证」：账号配置支持多个 IMAP 邮箱，可在工具调用中指定账号；认证可用密码、静态 access token，或 refresh token 加 client ID 自动换取访问令牌。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:47-88"]}
{"unit_id":"huaxiren6__DSH-EmailReader#caveat-1","repo":"huaxiren6/DSH-EmailReader","commit":"c96afef4427bf7dc359f5375e92ad6ac334a26b9","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-email-reader 使用配置的 IMAP 服务器读取邮件；启用 OAuth refresh token 时，会向令牌端点提交 refresh token 和 client ID 换取访问令牌。请配置可信的邮箱与令牌服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:98-122","src/index.js:129-153"]}
